WEBVTT

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.750
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:17.880
I won't forgive you.

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:19.160
What do you mean?

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:22.390
You are unaware
of your own beauty.

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:23.560
Uh?

00:01:24.830 --> 00:01:27.300
That outfit of yours
and your appearance...

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.670
They don't exemplify
your natural beauty.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.470
I am sorry because of that.

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:34.880
Ah... are you a beautician?

00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:37.140
I am an artist.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.010
Are you going on a date?

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:41.240
Y... Yes...

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:45.910
Then, before you go, could you
give me a bit of your time?

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:49.350
I would love to make
you more beautiful.

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:51.220
I'm sure your boyfriend
would appreciate it too.

00:01:52.130 --> 00:01:53.920
But... I...

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.420
Let's get off at the next station.

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:16.810
No... not again...

00:02:16.990 --> 00:02:18.180
Is that the sound of the wind?

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:21.780
I don't even wanna think about it!

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:19.340
Hey, why don't we
invite Ms. Yamano?

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.980
I don't know if she'd want to go.

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:23.650
She seems to have
different tastes from us.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.180
She just transferred
to this school, you know.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:28.560
We should initiate
conversation first!

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:31.390
If you think so, Chisato,
go right ahead.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:33.890
Ms. Yamano!

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:38.200
This Sunday, want to go out
to Yashirozaka with us?

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:39.700
Anything special going on?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.740
Nothing, just hanging around.
Let's go. Ok?

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:45.360
Why with me?

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:50.700
'Cause, you look gloomy, and I don't
think you'll make friends like that.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.650
You're straightforward.
Call me Miyu.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:56.350
That's great, Miyu!
Let's have lunch together.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:56.950
Ok?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.010
Ok...

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:03.420
Anyway...

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:05.520
Yukari is the best
student at school.

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.960
Hisae reads the most books.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.250
Don't exaggerate.

00:04:10.830 --> 00:04:12.770
Hey, Miyu, what is your forte?

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.960
Mine? Do I have to have one?

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:19.000
Not at all!
I don't have one, either.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.200
Well, you are cute.
That's good, isn't it?

00:04:21.480 --> 00:04:23.570
Hear that? She said I'm cute!

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.710
I guess so, you do have
those bunny-shaped apples.

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.070
My mom made these, not me!

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.810
Yeah, yeah, sure.

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:38.660
Pretty, isn't it?

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.150
Aren't they? Trees are nice.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:43.930
These are my favorite
trees at school.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.500
Miyu, what do you
do on your day off?

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.140
Nothing special really.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:57.270
Just as I thought, you are gloomy.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.570
You're just too hyper, that's all!

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:01.180
You're always saying that!

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:05.820
What's wrong, Hisae?

00:05:06.050 --> 00:05:07.780
This is the last car, right?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.680
Oh, that story?

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.390
Huh? What story?

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:12.820
You don't know?

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:18.090
There's a rumor that many
women have gone missing...

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.430
from the last car on this route.

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:21.900
No way... a kidnapping?

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:26.200
They haven't found anything.
I heard all of them were beautiful.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:37.110
The next stop is Yashirozaka.
The exit will be on the left.

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.850
What's wrong?
You look so out of it.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:53.030
Oh, nothing.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:54.790
Come on, hurry, hurry!

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:05.000
Oh, I wanna go there next!

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:05.770
There?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.540
Why not? Let's hurry and go.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.880
Miyu, isn't this cute?

00:06:15.420 --> 00:06:16.250
Yes, it is.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.560
It's called the icon of friendship...

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:22.150
you two can remain friends
forever when you have it.

00:06:22.630 --> 00:06:24.860
Really? Then I'll buy two.

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.360
For two, 800 yen will be fine.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.100
Thank you!

00:06:30.270 --> 00:06:31.070
Here, for you.

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:32.530
For me?

00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:34.370
To our friendship.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:37.010
Thank you.

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:46.620
Miyu, sometimes you
say weird things.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.580
Are they really so weird?

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:49.890
I mean...

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:52.520
Sometimes you talk like my grandpa.

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:54.090
She must be educated.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:02.100
Why does the fun
always end so soon?

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:04.060
We have to go back
to school tomorrow.

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:06.460
I wish I could stay a child forever.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:09.100
Do you think so?

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.540
Don't worry.

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:12.810
You'll definitely
stay a kid forever.

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.140
You said it again.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:18.840
Huh?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.260
What kind of store is that?

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.290
Huh?

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.970
Oh, we can go in if you want.

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:38.700
Clothes are expensive there and
more for twenty-something people.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:40.440
That store is for adults.

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.540
Oh, I see.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:54.250
Well, see you tomorrow at school.

00:07:54.360 --> 00:07:55.050
See you.

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.020
Good-bye.

00:07:56.090 --> 00:07:56.680
Good-bye.

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:57.450
Later.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:18.740
Friends?

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:04.290
See?

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.750
Doesn't this one-piece dress go well
with your skin tone?

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.530
Your body looks more slender, too.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:18.740
For your bracelet,
this would be good.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.280
You look so happy
with that little toy.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:08.620
Is that so bad?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:13.230
I don't see what's so good
about human beings.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.860
Miyu, I don't have to tell
you this often but...

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:18.760
I know.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:21.860
You shouldn't get
too close to these girls.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:24.390
You're the one who would be hurt.

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.070
I said I know.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:29.840
Anyway, setting that aside, what are
you gonna do with that Shinma.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.980
I don't like him making
trouble in my playground.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.320
We should send the
naughty boy home.

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:56.800
Recently, around the
Yashirozuka subway station...

00:10:56.870 --> 00:10:59.600
many young women have been
disappearing mysteriously.

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:02.280
Mr. Kawaguchi, what do you mean
by mysteriously disappearing?

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:03.640
Use your dictionary!

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:06.180
If you ever see a suspicious person...

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:09.110
report it to the station staff
or the police immediately.

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.940
One more thing, don't go out alone!

00:11:12.150 --> 00:11:12.980
Understood?

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:14.180
Yes.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:16.950
All right.
Then I'll take roll.

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:17.580
Aida.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:18.350
Yes!

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:19.120
Aoki.

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:19.720
Yes!

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:20.450
Akagawa.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.260
Yes!

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:21.950
Akimoto.

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:22.690
Yes!

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:23.660
Inoue.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:24.250
Yes!

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:40.380
Miss, are you by yourself?

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:45.850
My teacher told
me not to go out alone.

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:50.150
Do you mind my company, Mr. Shinma?

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:51.760
The Guardian!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.590
Do not try to escape from us.

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.730
You're the infamous traitor?

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:04.130
If you insult Lava,
I will not forgive you.

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:07.400
You're a scary girl.

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:09.200
Look out, Miyu!

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:19.510
The next stop is
Yashirozaka... Yashirozaka.

00:12:20.020 --> 00:12:21.950
Please exit to your left.

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.280
Shall we stop for now?

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:27.180
Perhaps, I might have
been a bit careless.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:29.100
But remember...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.060
this is my train!

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:11.460
There are two Yashirozaka stations.

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.370
Correct.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:15.970
This station was constructed
before World War II.

00:13:16.380 --> 00:13:18.370
Yet due to the changes
in city development...

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:20.440
this station is now
abandoned and unknown.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:23.250
This is a good hideout for a Shinma.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:26.020
A hideout? Far from it.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.110
This place is my gallery.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:32.210
I wanted to invite people who might
appreciate my beautiful collection.

00:13:32.660 --> 00:13:34.590
You are the first guest.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.860
Now, please come inside.

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:48.970
Once there were plans to connect
this underground shopping center...

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:51.010
to the next station.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:55.040
There are many places
like this in large cities.

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:57.450
I see, you take advantage of them.

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.210
I'd prefer you not speaking to
me as though I'm a criminal.

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:01.920
I am an artist.

00:14:02.820 --> 00:14:06.280
Please take a look at my creations.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:21.610
What do you think?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.810
Aren't they dazzling like jewels?

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.400
Their brilliance had never been
polished during their lifetimes.

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:33.250
Had these girls continued as they were,
they would have become old and ugly.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.910
But time has stopped for them.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.590
They can stay beautiful forever.

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:01.150
Can you not hear?
Their cries!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.280
What are you talking about?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.010
I was right... you're a Shinma.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.650
You would never understand
true human emotion.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.190
It's unfortunate that we
must say farewell...

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:13.320
before you understand
my aesthetics.

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:14.360
Yes.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:25.800
I will be glad to add
you to my collection.

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.270
You are a bit too young
for my taste though.

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:31.140
Oh, excuse me.

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:34.740
It is said the Guardian has
transcended the boundary of time...

00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.020
and remains a child forever.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.150
I have to buy teenager clothes.

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:49.190
W... What's that?!

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:10.840
Your spirit light is deceptive.
It will illuminate nothing.

00:16:11.050 --> 00:16:12.680
No truth will be seen with it.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:16.190
That's because you were
born out of Darkness.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.120
Go back to the Darkness quietly.

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:21.990
Is that all the preaching you've got?!

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:42.480
Why are you fighting against me?
You used to be like me...

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:46.220
I am now fighting with Miyu.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.690
My, my masterpiece!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.440
Stray Shinma, to the
Darkness with thee!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:30.760
What should we do with these women?

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:38.660
There's nothing I can do for them.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:43.970
They were charmed into something
they should never have wished for.

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.790
Maybe a talent scout would
come and talk to me...

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:04.260
if I walked around
in a place like this.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.700
Don't be such a dreamer!

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:08.100
That'd be so lucky!

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.230
A talent scout could have bad
intentions, you know.

00:18:10.340 --> 00:18:13.770
Chisato, do you really
think you're that cute?

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:17.300
Yes, I do! Right, Miyu?

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:22.310
Yes... but you're cute
just as you are now.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.050
Miyu, you are so weird!

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:26.040
Is that so?

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.120
Yes, yes!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.210
Chisato will say anything!
